AzaleaTown_Text_Rocker::
	.string "Cut through AZALEA and you’ll be in\n"
	.string "ILEX FOREST.\p"
	.string "But these skinny trees make it\n"
	.string "impossible to get through.\p"
	.string "The CHARCOAL MAN’s POKéMON can\n"
	.string "CUT down trees.$"

AzaleaTown_Text_RocketM2::
	.string "Do you know about SLOWPOKETAIL? I\n"
	.string "heard it’s tasty!\p"
	.string "Aren’t you glad I told you that?$"

