	.string "ILEX FOREST is restless!\p"
	.string "What is going on?$"

AzaleaTown_Text_BaldingMan_2::
	.string "{PLAYER}, here’s your GS BALL back!\p"
	.string "Could you go see why ILEX FOREST is\n"
	.string "so restless?$"

AzaleaTown_Text_BaldingMan_3::
	.string "Could you go see why ILEX FOREST is\n"
